OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start chilly with
OL,6,Ffog in the south and east, though
OL,7,Fbrighter with the odd coastal shower
OL,8,Felsewhere. Fog will gradually lift,
OL,9,Fleaving a mostly dry day with sunny
OL,10,Fspells in the afternoon. Pleasant
OL,11,Fenough in the light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,14,Fnight across the country. There will
OL,15,Fbe clear spells, but given light winds
OL,16,Fareas of fog and patchy frost are
OL,17,Flikely to re-form.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
