OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFog and frost should gradually
OL,6,Fclear again on Monday morning with
OL,7,Fsome sunshine breaking through into
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. An easterly breeze
OL,9,Fdeveloping as the day unfolds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FCloudier with rain arriving from the
OL,13,Fsouth on Tuesday, accompanied by a
OL,14,Fbrisk southeasterly breeze. Further
OL,15,Frain on Wednesday, then brighter, but
OL,16,Ffeeling colder on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
